# The built globe ENGINE bundle used to be synced here (735 MB) so the hero
# could run a live globe. It is gone: the hero is now one baked texture on a
# sphere (`src/scripts/hero-globe.js` + `public/hero/globe.webp`), and that
# texture IS committed — it carries no secret and it is 0.17 MB, so a fresh
# clone renders its own hero with no sync step. Refresh it after a palette
# change with `npm run sync-hero`.
